The "antiquity" content pack (pack.yaml in this folder) is generated by
tools/zeroad/convert.py from the simulation data of 0 A.D. by Wildfire Games
(https://play0ad.com, https://gitea.wildfiregames.com/0ad/0ad).

0 A.D. simulation data (binaries/data/) is licensed under the GNU General
Public License version 2 or (at your option) any later version. As a work
derived from it, this pack is distributed under the same terms:
GPL-2.0-or-later. See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html.

Civilization names, unit names and descriptions come from 0 A.D. The rest of
Ovian is MIT licensed; this folder is the exception.
